, "id": "msg_1797f067d001lTn35mhswqJDkb", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU"}, "parts": [{"snapshot": "d18faa6d254463edee0454cfb94507c90c29ad2d", "type": "step-start", "id": "prt_1797f2627001U70E002Ka1YOxf", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1797f067d001lTn35mhswqJDkb"}, {"type": "reasoning", "text": "The process is running but log is empty - Python buffers output. I should have used python3 -u. Let me wait for it to finish (it watches180s + boot ~10s + scan). Total ~4 min. Wait and poll.", "time": {"start": 1793039738410, "end": 1793039739390}, "id": "prt_1797f262a001tp5rxgeJG5ewUE", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1797f067d001lTn35mhswqJDkb"}, {"type": "tool", "tool": "bash", "callID": "call_7ab23844efdd4b1280ae867b", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"command": "for i in $(seq 1 30); do if ! ps -p 2140076 >/dev/null 2>&1; then echo FINISHED; break; fi; sleep 10; done; cat /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/tmp/mobile-hang2.log", "timeout": 330000}, "output": "FINISHED\n· open html throttle=4.0x img=/home/runner/hub-work/cover.jpg\n  DOMContentLoaded 2.6s\n  VERSION +2.8s (+0.2s)\n  OCR.ready +8.6s (+5.8s)\n  state {\"engine\": \"ready\", \"reason\": \"\", \"inMemory\": false, \"detLen\": 0}\n· import+open book\n  opened {'id': 'bmvplhn6jksdv', 'count': 1} +9.0s\n· scanPage watch 180 s\n  +  13.3s badge='Распознаём… 1/14' scanning=True done=False lines=None\n  +  22.1s badge='Распознаём… 2/14' scanning=True done=False lines=None\n  +  26.7s badge='Распознаём… 4/14' scanning=True done=False lines=None\n  +  27.9s badge='Распознаём… 6/14' scanning=True done=False lines=None\n  +  39.2s badge='Распознаём… 7/14' scanning=True done=False lines=None\n  +  51.6s badge='Распознаём… 8/14' scanning=True done=False lines=None\n  +  62.8s badge='Распознаём… 9/14' scanning=True done=False lines=None\n  +  63.9s badge='Распознаём… 11/14' scanning=True done=False lines=None\n  +  65.3s badge='Расп