 {"reason": "tool-calls", "snapshot": "d18faa6d254463edee0454cfb94507c90c29ad2d", "type": "step-finish", "tokens": {"total": 155700, "input": 281, "output": 99, "reasoning": 56, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 155264}}, "cost": 0, "id": "prt_179801833001W8vcygltxX6vvs", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1797f067d001lTn35mhswqJDkb"}]}, {"info": {"parentID": "msg_1797264b8001MKovw19BPjr4bF", "role": "assistant", "mode": "build", "agent": "build", "path": {"cwd": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code", "root": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code"}, "cost": 0, "tokens": {"total": 157505, "input": 692, "output": 130, "reasoning": 1163, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 155520}}, "modelID": "mimo-v2.6-flash-free", "providerID": "opencode", "time": {"created": 1793039800816, "completed": 1793039832377}, "finish": "tool-calls", "id": "msg_1798019f0001CWfCkJkA86NJAu", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU"}, "parts": [{"snapshot": "d18faa6d254463edee0454cfb94507c90c29ad2d", "type": "step-start", "id": "prt_17980368f001fvJX0F0wqd0qIN", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1798019f0001CWfCkJkA86NJAu"}, {"type": "reasoning", "text": "Progress is now visible - badge updates every few seconds (1/14 through 14/14). But two issues:\n\n1. **WATCH EXPIRED - still scanning? True** - after 14/14 at 91.4s, scanning stayed True until 180s+! The per-box progress finished but something AFTER the box loop hangs: large text pass, uncoveredBands, readingOrder, savePageBuffer, or paintPage?\n\n2. detLen: 0 - freeEmbeddedModels worked (strings freed).\n\n3. Boxes=14 now vs 3 before? Different - wait, previously full run showed 3 boxes for full page, but band scan had... first mobile test had badge 2/3 (3 boxes). Now 14 boxes? Interesting - maybe because... hmm, first test was before my code changes but image same. Why 14 boxes now?\n\nOh wait - first mobile test: badge went 2/3, 3/3 - 3 boxes. Now 14 boxes. What changed? I didn't change detector. Unless... first test the page was recognized as visible band vs full page differently?\n\nActually first test: scanPage with force - visibleBandPx. Cover is 720x2960, viewH=844*dpr stuff... c.height=2960, viewH = scroller.clientHeight (~844 CSS px?) * scale. 2960 <= viewH*2.2? If viewH in page px = r.height... for vertical mode, wrap rect height might be full page height scaled to screen. This is confusing.\n\nFirst test got 3 boxes, now 14 - maybe non-determinism in detector, or first test's 3/3 was a band with3 boxes and my first test... both used same script and image.\n\nWait first run: `badge='Распознаём… 2/3'` - total 3. Second: 1/14 total 14. Hmm. Could early-stop/decode changes affect detector? No. Unless... first run was on different code (v1.9.12) same detector.\n\nOh! Maybe first run used `visibleBandPx` returning a small band (few boxes), second run... same code path. Unless Reader.page/mode differ. Both opened same way.\n\nActually could be `detRetry` path: if first detect finds boxes use them; detectWithRetry only when zero boxes. Band differences?\n\nOr - non-max suppression randomness? Unlikely.\n\nRegardless - the CRITICAL bug: after 14/14 boxes done at 91s, **still scanning at 180s** - hung for 90+ seconds in post-box work: large text pass (pass 2) or uncoveredBands (pass 3).\n\nLarge text pass: for each entry, if conditions, recognizeLargeBox - can do detectBoxes + many decodes. uncoveredBands: searches for ink bands without boxes, textLines + decodeLine.\n\nFor a2960px band region with illustration noise, uncoveredBands could find MANY bands each with lines, each line decodeLine with extension = long. And I only yield in decodeLine ext and decodeCrop - uncovered loop has no per-line yield!\n\nLet me check uncoveredBands and recognizeLargeBox loops for yields. Also badge doesn't update in passes 2-3 at all (onProgress only in pass 1).\n\nFixes needed:\n1. onProgress updates in large pass and uncovered pass (or at least badge heartbeat)\n2. yieldUI in recognizeLargeBox line loops and uncovered loops\n3. Possibly time-budget for uncovered pass\n\nAlso why still scanning after 14/14 for 90s - need to identify which pass. Let me instrument: add console/debug or watch DECODE_STATS. Quick approach: evaluate during watch - but scanning blocks evaluate... with yieldUI in decodeCrop, evaluate should work now!\n\nLet me add to mobile_hang watch loop: also read DECODE_STATS and detMs - actually modify watch to print more state: `window.__phase`. Better: patch recognizePage to set `window.__ocrPhase = 'detect'|'lines'|'large'|'uncovered'`.\n\nI'll add lightweight phase markers for diagnosis and production-friendly progress:\n- Pass 2 large: call onProgress(done + 0.95, total) or a badge message\n- Pass 3 uncovered: same\n\nSimplest UX: scanPage callback stays; recognizePage sets nothing. Add yields + onProgress calls:\n\nIn large pass loop: `if (onProgress) onProgress(det.boxes.length - 0.5 + idx/entries.length, ...)` messy.\n\nBetter: extend onProgress contract: second arg total, first done can be `total + largeDone/...`?Cleaner: pass a different progress string. Look at scanPage callback - it only does done/total. I could change recognizePage to call `onProgress(done, total, phase)` and scanPage shows phase:\n\n```js\nconst res = await recognizePage(c, RULES, (done, total, phase) => {\n  const t = phase ? `Распознаём… ${phase} ${Math.ceil(done)}/${total}` : `Распознаём… ...`;\n```\n\nPhases: pass1 boxes as now; pass2 `крупный`; pass3 `доп. области`.\n\nLet me look at uncoveredBands and recognizeLargeBox to add yields.", "time": {"start": 1793039808145, "end": 1793039830790}, "id": "prt_179803691001evsEW9LC0jfiAn", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1798019f0001CWfCkJkA86NJAu"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Бейдж живой, но после 14/14 зависло ещё на 90+ с — это проходы «крупный текст» и «непокрытые области». Добавляю там progress + yield:", "time": {"start": 1793039830793, "end": 1793039832299}, "id": "prt_179808f080011vI3w9Gek5x5Xw", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1798019f0001CWfCkJkA86NJAu"}, {"type": "tool", "tool": "bash", "callID": "call_afa38fbaa6224d6eb0086396", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"command": "cd /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code && sed -n '3700,3795p' koma-web.html && echo ======== && sed -n '3850,3960p' koma-web.html"}, "output": "  }\n\n  return {\n    regions, boxes: det.boxes.length,\n    ms: Math.round(performance.now() - t0),\n    detMs, recMs: Math.round(performance.now() - t1), crops,\n    band: band ? { y0, y1 } : null,\n    detPass: det.pass,\n    largePasses,\n    variantRuns: DECODE_STATS.variantRuns,\n    variantsPicked: DECODE_STATS.variantsPicked,\n    uncoveredLines: DECODE_STATS.uncoveredLines,\n    wordsTried: DECODE_STATS.wordsTried,\n    wordsFixed: DECODE_STATS.wordsFixed,\n  };\n}\n\n/**\n * Строки с текстом, которые детектор НЕ закрыл ни одним боксом.\n *\n * На скриншоте 12:54 средняя строка титула («жизнь, будучи») не попала ни в\n * один бокс и пропала из текста. Ищем по кадру полосы, где есть «чернила», но\n * нет боксов, и отдаём их на распознавание — чтобы не терять слова.\n */\nfunction uncoveredBands(src, boxes, R) {\n  const out = [];\n  const SW = 200;                                   // рабочая ширина\n  const k = SW / src.width;\n  const w = SW, h = Math.max(8, Math.round(src.height * k));\n  const small = makeCanvas(w, h);\n  const ctx = small.getContext('2d', { willReadFrequently: true });\n  ctx.drawImage(src, 0, 0, w, h);\n  const luma = lumaFrom(ctx.getImageData(0, 0, w, h).data, w, h);\n  const thr = inkThreshold(luma, R);\n  if (thr < 0) return out;\n  const covered = new Uint8Array(h);\n  for (const b of boxes) {\n    const y0 = Math.max(0, Math.floor(b.top * k) - 2);\n    const y1 = Math.min(h - 1, Math.ceil(b.bottom * k) + 2);\n    for (let y = y0; y <= y1; y++) covered[y] = 1;\n  }\n  const need = Math.max(2, Math.round(w * 0.02));   // сколько тёмного в строке\n  const hasInk = (y) => {\n    let cnt = 0;\n    for (let x = 0; x < w; x++) if (luma[y * w + x] < thr) { if (++cnt >= need) return true; }\n    return false;\n  };\n  const runs = [];\n  let y = 0;\n  while (y < h) {\n    if (covered[y] || !hasInk(y)) { y++; continue; }\n    let end = y;\n    while (end < h && !covered[end] && hasInk(end)) end++;\n    if (end - y >= 3) runs.push([y, end]);\n    y = Math.max(end, y + 1);\n  }\n  for (const [a, b] of runs) {\n    const top = clamp(Math.floor(a / k) - 3, 0, src.height - 1);\n    const bottom = clamp(Math.ceil(b / k) + 3, top + 1, src.height);\n    out.push({ left: 0, top, right: src.width, bottom });\n  }\n  return out.slice(0, 12);\n}\n\n/** Медиана высоты реплик на странице — по ней отличаем крупный текст. */\n/** Сколько букв в наборе строк. */\nfunction lettersOf(texts) {\n  let n = 0;\n  for (const t of texts || []) n += (String(t).match(/\\p{L}/gu) || []).length;\n  return n;\n}\n\n/** Доля слов, известных словарю: по ней видно «трудный» текст. */\nfunction knownShare(texts) {\n  let all = 0, known = 0;\n  for (const t of texts || []) {\n    for (const w of String(t).match(/[\\p{L}\\p{N}]{2,}/gu) || []) {\n      all++;\n      if (!Words.ready || Words.isKnown(w.toLowerCase()) || Words.isPlausible(w.toLowerCase())) known++;\n    }\n  }\n  return all ? known / all : 0;\n}\n\nfunction medianLineHeight(byBox) {\n  const hs = [];\n  for (const e of byBox) for (const i of e.items) hs.push(i.bottom - i.top);\n  hs.sort((a, b) => a - b);\n  return hs.length ? hs[hs.length >> 1] : 0;\n}\n\n/**\n * Насколько текст похож на настоящий: сколько слов знает словарь. По этой\n * оценке выбираем между первым и вторым проходом («будучи» лучше «будучиг»).\n */\nfunction qualityOf(texts) {\n========\n  return out;\n}\n\n/**\n * Второй проход по крупному блоку: увеличить кроп, найти боксы заново,\n * разбить на строки и распознать каждую. Координаты возвращаются в системе\n * всей страницы, чтобы рамки стояли на месте.\n */\nasync function recognizeLargeBox(src, box, R, ctxInfo) {\n  const out = { items: [], crops: 0 };\n  const pad = Math.round((box.bottom - box.top) * 0.10);\n  const left = clamp(box.left - pad, 0, src.width - 1);\n  const right = clamp(box.right + pad, 1, src.width);\n  const top = clamp(box.top - pad, 0, src.height - 1);\n  const bottom = clamp(box.bottom + pad, 1, src.height);\n  const bw = right - left, bh = bottom - top;\n  if (bw < 40 || bh < 20) return out;\n  const k = clamp(Math.round(1200 / Math.max(bw, bh)), 1, 4);\n  if (k < 2) return out;                       // мелкий блок увеличивать незачем\n  const up = makeCanvas(Math.round(bw * k), Math.round(bh * k));\n  const uctx = up.getContext('2d', { willReadFrequently: true });\n  uctx.imageSmoothingEnabled = true; uctx.imageSmoothingQuality = 'high';\n  uctx.drawImage(src, left, top, bw, bh, 0, 0, up.width, up.height);\n  // Бледная каллиграфия на белом не даёт чернильных строк на исходном кропе.\n  // Поэтому пробуем три подготовки кадра и берём ту, где текст получился\n  // осмысленнее: увеличено / с растянутой яркостью / бинаризовано.\n  const full = { left: 0, top: 0, right: up.width, bottom: up.height };\n  const variants = [\n    up,\n    contrastCanvas(up),\n    binarizeCanvas(up, 0, R),\n  ];\n  let best = null;\n  for (const work of variants) {\n    const boxes = await detectBoxes(work, R.pageSide, R);\n    const lines = [];\n    for (const b of boxes) for (const ln of textLines(work, b, R)) lines.push(ln);\n    if (lines.length < 2) {\n      for (const ln of textLines(work, full, R)) {\n        if (!lines.some(o => Math.abs(o.top - ln.top) < 4)) lines.push(ln);\n      }\n    }\n    if (!lines.length) continue;\n    const got = await decodeLargeLines(work, lines, R, { k, left, top, src, ctxInfo });\n    out.crops += got.crops;\n    if (!got.items.length) continue;\n    const score = qualityOf(got.items.map(i => i.text)) + Math.min(got.items.length, 6) * 3;\n    i