nning=True done=False lines=None\n  + 174.6s badge='Распознаём… крупный текст 12/14' scanning=True done=False lines=None\n  + 187.3s badge='Распознаём… крупный текст 13/14' scanning=True done=False lines=None\n  + 197.3s badge='Распознаём… области без боксов 1/4' scanning=True done=False lines=None\n  + 198.5s badge='Распознаём… области без боксов 2/4' scanning=True done=False lines=None\n  + 200.7s badge='Распознаём… области без боксов 4/4' scanning=False done=True lines=3\n  RESULT done err= None lines= 3\n· console tail\n   (4.9, 'info', 'модели засеяны из вшитых копий')\ndone\n", "exit": 0, "truncated": false}, "title": "for i in $(seq 1 36); do pgrep -f mobile_hang.py >/dev/null || break; sleep 10; done; cat /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/tmp/mobile-hang3.log", "time": {"start": 1793040247284, "end": 1793040607751}}, "id": "prt_17986e9dc001awnXGKIAq6hhr6", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_17986bcfd001jV71Sm7kWEhgwX"}, {"reason": "tool-calls", "snapshot": "8dd4f5466ee4a83d0b26b3e7bfff909d83a98e81", "type": "step-finish", "tokens": {"total": 164917, "input": 202, "output": 83, "reasoning": 24, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 164608}}, "cost": 0, "id": "prt_1798c6a23001Bq42UoPqQyixWs", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_17986bcfd001jV71Sm7kWEhgwX"}]}, {"info": {"parentID": "msg_1797264b8001MKovw19BPjr4bF", "role": "assistant", "mode": "build", "agent": "build", "path": {"cwd": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code", "root": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code"}, "cost": 0, "tokens": {"total": 167121, "input": 1100, "output": 370, "reasoning": 915, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 164736}}, "modelID": "mimo-v2.6-flash-free", "providerID": "opencode", "time": {"created": 1793040608264, "completed": 1793040641526}, "finish": "tool-calls", "id": "msg_1798c6c08001CnROJpHnrCsJuW", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU"}, "parts": [{"snapshot": "8dd4f5466ee4a83d0b26b3e7bfff909d83a98e81", "type": "step-start", "id": "prt_1798c8202001EDQXVa5VxsACHG", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1798c6c08001CnROJpHnrCsJuW"}, {"type": "reasoning", "text": "Excellent! The scan completed in 200.7s (vs hanging past 180s+ before with no visibility). Badge now updates continuously through all phases:\n- pass1: 1/14...13/14 (~87s)\n- pass2 large: 1/14...13/14 (~87-197s)\n- pass3 uncovered: 1/4...4/4 (~197-200s)\n- RESULT: done, lines=3\n\nNo more \"looks hung\" - user always sees progress. Total on 4x throttled phone-emulation ~200s for the tall cover - long but visibly progressing.\n\nWait - pass1 never showed 14/14, went 13/14 -> large. Looking at code: pass1 onProgress after each box with done++ - last box should show 14/14. Timeline jumped from 13/14 at 77.7s to крупный1/14 at 87s - maybe 14/14 appeared between samples... anyway fine.\n\nAlso note first test before fixes:3 boxes total. Now 14 boxes? That was inconsistent - first mobile run showed 2/3, 3/3. Different from14. Hmm - maybe first run was v1.9.12 with different... no detector unchanged. Could first run have been a full-page scan (c.height <= viewH*2.2 -> band null -> page mode) vs band? First run: badge 2/3 - 3 boxes. Second: 14 boxes.\n\nOh! First run - after my scanPage force - `opts.full` not set, band = visibleBandPx. Same both times. Weird. Unless non-determinism in detector NMS... or first run's 3 boxes was actually pass done quickly because... Actually looking at first mobile log again: `+24.0s badge='Распознаём… 2/3'` - only 3 total. Second/third: 14 total.\n\nDifference between run1 and run2: run1 was v1.9.12, run2 was v1.9.13 with yieldUI. Detector code unchanged... Unless CPU throttle timing affects nothing in detector determinism.\n\nWait - could it be `detectWithRetry`? If first detect finds boxes, use them. Should be deterministic.\n\nOR - first run's evaluate was starved so early badge samples missed - badge went 1/14... but total was shown as 3 not 14. `Распознаём… 2/3` - total=3 is det.boxes.length. So genuinely 3 boxes.\n\nHmm - different band? visibleBandPx depends on layout/scroll. First run after openBook - scroll position. Could differ? Both fresh opens, same viewport. Should be same.\n\nActually first run: lines=1 result. Third run: lines=3. Different results! Non-determinism somewhere - maybe different band keys or Image decode race.\n\nNot critical for the hang fix. The fix works: progress visible, completes.\n\nDesktop e2e still 6/6.\n\nNow: commit, push, release v1.9.13 (replace v1.9.12 assets or new tag). Also copy to tmp/ for download.\n\nShould I also reduce pass2 time? \"крупный текст\" took ~110s on throttled phone for the tall cover - still long but with visible progress. User complaint was \"hang\" - now it's visible. Could optimize pass2 more (fewer variants) but that risks accuracy. The e2e title fix still works.\n\nOptional: cap pass2 to skip when box already has good quality text - existing condition hard||big. Fine.\n\nLet me also double-check: freeEmbeddedModels - seed on second load with existing models calls free - good. detLen:0 in test confirms.\n\nCommit as v1.9.13, push, create release. Update tmp/koma-web.html copy.\n\nAlso run a quick sanity that6/6 already done (v1913b PASS).\n\nOne more issue: pass1 badge skipped 14/14 -> went to крупный - minor.\n\nCommit!", "time": {"start": 1793040613894, "end": 1793040629024}, "id": "prt_1798c820600153uKa74AF94Civ", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1798c6c08001CnROJpHnrCsJuW"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Зависание устранено: бейдж идёт все фазы, прогон завершился за 200 с (раньше — молоток без визуала). Коммичу и пушу:", "time": {"start": 1793040629027, "end": 1793040635739}, "id": "prt_1798cbd23001zyJ4yc9RdRGZ0u", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1798c6c08001CnROJpHnrCsJuW"}, {"type": "tool", "tool": "bash", "callID": "call_e741fe87fb074f2980ff152f", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"command": "cd /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code && git add koma-web.html && git diff --cached --stat && git commit -m \"v1.9.13: распознавание больше не «виснет» на телефоне\n\n- yieldUI (macrotask) в decodeCrop/строках/подготовках: await давал только\n  микрозадачи — браузер не красил бейдж и не ел ввод, телефон выглядел зависшим\n- прогон 2 (крупный текст) и 3 (области без боксов) показывают прогресс в бейдже\n- skipExt для непокрытых областей: не гонять 18 подготовок кропа на шуме\n- ранний выход расширения кропа при всех словарных словах\n- base64 моделей освобождается после автосида (~30 МБ V8-кучи)\n- e2e 6/6 PASS без wordFixes; мобильная эмуляция 4x: бейдж обновляется\n  на каждой фазе, прогон завершается (200 с на 2960px)\" && git push && git log --oneline -3"}, "output": " koma-web.html | 61 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------\n 1 file changed, 48 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)\n[fix/title-line-crop 43de94e] v1.9.13: распознавание больше не «виснет» на телефоне\n 1 file changed, 48 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)\nTo https://github.com/sj0404-collab/yomikai-web.git\n   99746fe..43de94e  fix/title-line-crop -> fix/title-line-crop\n43de94e v1.9.13: распознавание больше не «виснет» на телефоне\n99746fe v1.9.12: встроить модели ONNX в html (автосида IndexedDB)\n9139374 fix: различать словарные слова и словоформы в textScore\n", "metadata": {"output": " koma-web.html | 61 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------\n 1 file changed, 48 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)\n[fix/title-line-crop 43de94e] v1.9.13: распознавание больше не «виснет» на телефоне\n 1 file changed, 48 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)\nTo https://github.com/sj0404-collab/yomikai-web.git\n   99746fe..43de94e  fix/title-line-crop -> fix/title-line-crop\n43de94e v1.9.13: распознавание больше не «виснет» на телефоне\n99746fe v1.9.12: встроить модели ONNX в html (автосида IndexedDB)\n9139374 fix: различать словарные слова и словоформы в textScore\n", "exit": 0, "truncated": false}, "title": "cd /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code && git add koma-web.html && git diff --cached --stat && git commit -m \"v1.9.13: распознавание больше не «виснет» на телефоне\n\n- yieldUI (macrotask) в decodeCrop/строках/подготовках: await давал только\n  микрозадачи — браузер не красил бейдж и не ел ввод, телефон выглядел зависшим\n- прогон 2 (крупный текст) и 3 (области без боксов) показывают прогресс в бейдже\n- skipExt для непокрытых областей: не гонять 18 подготовок кропа на шуме\n- ранний выход расширения кропа при всех словарных словах\n- base64 моделей освобождается после автосида (~30 МБ V8-кучи)\n- e2e 6/6 PASS без wordFixes; мобильная эмуляция 4x: бейдж обновляется\n  на каждой фазе, прогон завершается (200 с на 2960px)\" && git push && git log --oneline -3", "time": {"start": 1793040635689, "end": 1793040641477}}, "id": "prt_1798cc32c001aQjyxb8b4wscSy", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1798c6c08001CnROJpHnrCsJuW"}, {"reason": "tool-calls", "snapshot": "8dd4f5466ee4a83d0b26b3e7bfff909d83a98e81", "type": "step-finish", "tokens": {"total": 167121, "input": 1100, "output": 370, "reasoning": 915, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 164736}}, "cost": 0, "id": "prt_1798ceddc001lyG0g1mTABcge2", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1798c6c08001CnROJpHnrCsJuW"}]}, {"info": {"parentID": "msg_1797264b8001MKovw19BPjr4bF", "role": "assistant", "mode": "build", "agent": "build", "path": {"cwd": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code", "root": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code"}, "cost": 0, "tokens": {"total": 167764, "input": 1587, "output": 395, "reasoning": 22, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 165760}}, "modelID": "mimo-v2.6-flash-free", "providerID": "opencode", "time": {"created": 1793040642007, "completed": 1793040662735}, "finish": "tool-calls", "id": "msg_1798cefd7001E299EhhVXHkCze", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU"}, "parts": [{"snapshot": "8dd4f5466ee4a83d0b26b3e7bf