C2iVQn", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_179970e29001TNzAdIEznu0Qbk"}, {"type": "reasoning", "text": "The merge worked and pushed to main. Now let me verify everything is in order and then summarize for the user.\n\nLet me provide a final summary of what was accomplished.", "time": {"start": 1793041306500, "end": 1793041306876}, "id": "prt_179971384001D9Qz6O23ByGmSI", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_179970e29001TNzAdIEznu0Qbk"}, {"type": "text", "text": "The merge and push succeeded. All source files are now on the `main` branch with the v1.9.13 changes including:\n\n- **Embedded models**: `DET_GZ_B64`/`REC_GZ_B64`/`CRDICT_GZ_B64` in `koma-web.html` (~25.6 MB)\n- **Auto-seed**: `seedEmbeddedModels()` runs in `boot()`, populates IndexedDB on first open\n- **Mobile hang fix**: `yieldUI()` at 7 locations prevents macrotask starvation; badge shows all 3 phases\n- **VERSION**: v1.9.13\n- **e2e**: 6/6 PASS без wordFixes\n- **GitHub release**: https://github.com/sj0404-collab/yomikai-web/releases/tag/v1.9.13\n\n**Download links**:\n- `tmp/koma-web.html` (25.6 MB) — вкладка «Файлы»\n- `tmp/koma-web-models.zip` (11.7 MB) — запасной путь ручного импорта\n- GitHub release: https://github.com/sj0404-collab/yomikai-web/releases/tag/v1.9.13\n\n**User actions**: Open `koma-web.html` on phone → auto-seeds models → ready for cover import.", "time": {"start": 1793041306877, "end": 1793041310186}, "id": "prt_1799714fd0014Png5hCZhLkzTt", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_179970e29001TNzAdIEznu0Qbk"}, {"reason": "stop", "snapshot": "2cfba7a2295b139470bbf90d6ec9b88160d48858", "type": "step-finish", "tokens": {"total": 177207, "input": 802, "output": 307, "reasoning": 34, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 176064}}, "cost": 0, "id": "prt_1799721fc0014Lg52EZindsCQc", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_179970e29001TNzAdIEznu0Qbk"}]}]}}]}